==Icelandic==

===Etymology===
From {{inh|is|non|deyja}}, from {{inh|is|gem-pro|*dawjaną}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|is|/ˈteiːja/}}
*: {{rhymes|is|eiːja|s=2}}
*: {{hmp|is|deigja}}

===Verb===
{{is-verb-strong|dó|dóu|dáið}}

# {{lb|is|intransitive}} to [[die]]
#: {{syn|is|andast|sálast|fá bana|látast|q5=archaic|deyja burt|sofna svefninum langa|sofna hinsta svefni}}
#: {{uxi|is|Hún '''dó''' úr krabbameini.|She '''died''' of cancer.}}
#: {{uxi|is|Hundruð manna '''dóu''' úr hor.|Hundreds '''died''' of hunger.}}
#: {{uxi|is|Við munum öll '''deyja'''!|We are all going to '''die'''!}}
#: {{uxi|is|Að '''deyja''' úr kulda.|To '''die''' from exposure.}}
# {{lb|is|intransitive}} to [[pass out]] from drinking
# {{lb|is|intransitive|of fire}} to [[go out]]
#: {{syn|is|slokkna}}
# {{lb|is|intransitive|nautical|of the ocean}} to [[calm down]], to [[subside]]
#: {{syn|is|stillast|lygna}}
# {{lb|is|intransitive|of grass}} to [[wither]]
#: {{syn|is|falla|sölna}}

