===Verb===
{{non-verb|dó|dó|dáinn}}

# to [[die]]
#* '''800s''', ''{{w|Hávamál}}'', verse 76
#*: {{quote|non|'''Deyr''' fé, / '''deyja''' frændr,<br>'''deyr''' sjalfr it sama,<br>en orðstírr / '''deyr''' aldregi,<br>hveim er sér góðan getr.|Cattle '''die''', / kinsmen '''die''';<br>the self '''dies''' the same.<br>But a word-glory / never '''dies'''<br>for him, who a good one gets.}}

